{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ遅くなりました(°_°)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈のイヤリングのさくらんぼを狙う\nより目ができなくて怖い顔に\nなってしまった伊藤純奈と\nより目が得意でさくらんぼを\n勢いよく狙ってるのに困る\n北野日奈子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7日の夜に、ひなデビルのブログを\n書いていたら突然画面が真っ赤になり\n電源が落ちてそのあと携帯が起動しなくなってしまい、壊れていました(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8日の夜に新しいのに変えたのですが、\nデータが全部消えてしまい\n携帯が1からのスタートで\nヘコんでました。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなデビルの画像ももちろん\n今までの画像や動画やいろんな物が\n全て消えちゃったよー。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に悲しいーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ひなデビルのブログを書く約束はちゃんと守るよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またお家でデビルになって、写真とる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、次の次の次くらいのブログぐらいに書くね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に待たせてしまいごめんなさい。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は質問をかえします！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんにきいちゃおう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きぃちゃん、髪の毛切ってメイクも変えた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→髪の毛切って軽くしたらなんだか、普段のメイクが濃く見えちゃうようになったから、アイメイク薄くしたんだよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいてくれてありがとう(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デビルだから、トマトジュース？\nあれ？\nでも、トマトジュースは吸血鬼だったか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回のコスプレは、バンパイアで決定だね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→デビルだからトマトジュースだと思って書いたらトマトジュースは吸血鬼だっ！！！\nバンパイア('∀`)かっくいい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんの好きなキャラクターはなに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→最近はね、またケアベアが好きになったの♪他にはパワーパフガールズも好きだし、アマールカとかcocoちゃん系のもすき♡\nディズニーでは、ティンカーベル、マリーちゃん、ティガーすき♡\nサンリオならね、シナモロールが1番♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなデビルに僕も会いに行きたかったな～(>_<)/~~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またどこかでやってね\n次はひなエンジェルもやっちゃおう(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→エンジェル！！！天使になんてなれないよ～(´･_･`)絶対に合わないとおもう(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悪魔の次は天使もやるの？ てか天使ってなかなかないか！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→天使！！！やってみたいけど、似合わないとおもう(´･_･`)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マジすかの時のあっちゃんは多分黒系のセーラーだったよね？\nそれもきてみよう(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→そーだった！黒系のセーラー服だった！今度黒系のセーラー服も着たいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入りの、トマトジュースは何ですか？キャロットジュースも美味しいよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→実はトマトジュース飲めません。\nデビルを着てたから、デビルになりきるために、好物を書いたらトマトジュースが好物なのはバンパイアだったーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トマトジュースは無塩派？\nそれとも有塩派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとも野菜ジュース派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→トマトジュースを100%では飲めないけど、野菜ジュースにトマトも実は入ってます！っていうのは飲めます！だから、野菜ジュース派！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃん髪黒くしました？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→そうなの！黒くしたよ！\n髪の毛染めてもすぐ色が抜けちゃって明るくなっちゃうから、もう地毛ぐらいの黒にしたの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日に当てるともう茶色いよ(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんってロングの時ってあったの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ありましたよ！高校1年生の夏まで未央奈で言うブラックロングロングヘアーだったんだ♪\n小学校とか中1の時はボブとかミディアムの時もあったけど、ずーっと伸ばしてたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな色はなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→好きな色か～！ピンクと黄色と黄緑と、白と赤とメロンソーダ色といちごみるく色！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんはメガネ買うとしたら何色が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→初代メガネちゃんは赤とオレンジっぽい色が二色入ってるメガネで、\n二代目が青で、三代目が紺と黒を一緒に買ったよ♪よく使ってるのは紺！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまほしい色はーっ、緑！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"牛さんよく似合ってる（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→牛さんじゃない！牛さんじゃないよーっ！\nデ！ビ！ル！だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなデビルだもーん(´･_･`)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デビルいいやーん(^w^)\nツノゴキブリだね(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ツノゴキブリじゃない！ツノゴキブリじゃないよーっ！\nデ！ビ！ル！だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなデビルだもーん(´･_･`)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(2回目)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなデビルも好評...って事でOKですか？(￣▽￣;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→好評ってことで逆にいいですかね？(｡-∀-｡)笑\n私は自分でデビル気に入ってます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りゃーーーんって...\nなんですか(｡-_-｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→りゃーーーんはりゃーーーんだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りゃーーーーーーーーーんっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ひなデビルが現れた時の音)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんデビルはデビルなのにガオーやるの？\nそれともなんか違うことするの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→デビルでもがおーってやるよ！\nもちろん違うこともするよっ！\nなんでも、おっしゃってください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きぃちゃんは握手会でどんなこと話すのがすきですか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→うーん！なんでも楽しいですよ！どんな内容でも、わくわくしながら握手会してるから楽しい♪チップの話題とかMr.Childrenさんの話とか、結構します♪\n今食べたい物とかどこに行きたいとかそんな話もよくするよ(ノ_・。)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のきいちゃんにきいちゃおう！は\nここまでだーーいっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またすぐにやるから、質問とかなんでもコメントしてください(｡-_-｡)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんがきいちゃおう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの好きな今季のドラマはなんですかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はねーっあれとあれとあれとあれとあれ！笑\n皆さんが教えてくれたら私もいいます(´ー｀)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではおやすみなさい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあしたブログ書きますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/05/11/3513911/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"車の中で撮ったから、ぶれぶれだーー"}],"source":"archive"}